  "prefLabel": "Nur 101.11 Medication nursing assistant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 101.11 “Medication nursing assistant” means a licensed nursing assistant who holds a currently valid certificate authorizing the delegation to the nursing assistant of tasks of medication administration.\n\nSource. #8777, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10296, eff 3-22-13 (from Nur 101.11); ss by #10569, eff 4-17-14 (from Nur 101.11) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Nur 100); renumbered by #13672 (formerly Nur 101.12)",
